libpulse calls these callbacks from pa_mainloop_iterate(), inside the
host library that the foreign-dlopen trampoline runs with glibc's TLS.
Their bodies call back into musl (malloc through FFstrbuf), so each one
switches to the native TLS for its body (dlopen_callback_enter/exit, from
graphics.gd's dlopen.c).

--- a/src/detection/sound/sound_linux.c
